      "description": "In 2020, the IEAI established the Q&A Series: Reflections on AI. This series aims to engage with our invited speakers and IEAI affiliates in a more intimate and accessible way. During these monthly installments, the IEAI team has the pleasure of speaking to the experts and posing a set of important AI ethics-related questions."
